 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>当无法使用 ipcalc 时，可以考虑使用 shell 实现一个 ipcalc.sh。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Mysql 性能测试报告惨不忍睹的一次原因</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2019/06/a-case-of-mysql-performance/</link><pubDate>Sat, 01 Jun 2019 11:24:20 +0800</pubDate><author>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</author><guid>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2019/06/a-case-of-mysql-performance/</guid><category domain="https://travisbikkle.github.io/categories/archived/">Archived</category><description>&lt;h2 id="背景" class="heading-element">&lt;span>背景&lt;/span>
 &lt;a href="#%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af" class="heading-mark">
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z">&lt;/path>&lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>新版本发布在即，新增与kafka，zk，redis等其它服务合设的场景，因此需要性能测试探个底。但是性能测试人员反馈，分设与合设性能差距数万倍。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Mysql Jdbc 报错 Operation Not Allowed After Statement Closed</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2019/06/mysql-jdbc-operation-not-allowed/</link><pubDate>Sat, 01 Jun 2019 11:24:19 +0800</pubDate><author>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</author><guid>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2019/06/mysql-jdbc-operation-not-allowed/</guid><category domain="https://travisbikkle.github.io/categories/archived/">Archived</category><description>&lt;h2 id="背景" class="heading-element">&lt;span>背景&lt;/span>
 &lt;a href="#%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af" class="heading-mark">
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z">&lt;/path>&lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>业务上来说，连你们的mysql连不上，连别人的（其它部门的mysql）都能连上。查看其日志，报了一行错误&amp;quot;No
operations allowed after statement closed&amp;quot;。
这句话的意思，说的很清楚，不应该用关闭后的statement执行查询。但是因为我们是服务化的mysql，公司在遇到问题甩锅给其它部门的习惯由来已久，所以还是要帮业务解决。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Mysql Order By 对同一值的 Varchar 列排序问题</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2019/05/mysql-order-by-varchar/</link><pubDate>Fri, 24 May 2019 11:24:03 +0800</pubDate><author>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</author><guid>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2019/05/mysql-order-by-varchar/</guid><category domain="https://travisbikkle.github.io/categories/archived/">Archived</category><description>&lt;h2 id="背景" class="heading-element">&lt;span>背景&lt;/span>
