select * from information_schema.processlist;
select * from information_schema.processlist where state like &amp;quot;%Waiting%&amp;quot;;
select * from information_schema.innodb_trx;
SELECT * FROM INFORMATION_SCHEMA.INNODB_LOCK_WAITS;

SELECT INNODB_LOCKS.*
FROM INNODB_LOCKS
JOIN INNODB_LOCK_WAITS
 ON (INNODB_LOCKS.LOCK_TRX_ID = INNODB_LOCK_WAITS.BLOCKING_TRX_ID);

SELECT * FROM INNODB_LOCKS
WHERE LOCK_TABLE = db_name.table_name;

SELECT TRX_ID, TRX_REQUESTED_LOCK_ID, TRX_MYSQL_THREAD_ID, TRX_QUERY
FROM INNODB_TRX
WHERE TRX_STATE = 'LOCK WAIT';

show engine innodb status;
&lt;/code>&lt;/pre></description></item><item><title>Mysql 远程无法连接问题定位记录</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2019/02/mysql-remote-connect-failed/</link><pubDate>Fri, 01 Feb 2019 11:24:09 +0800</pubDate><author>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</author><guid>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2019/02/mysql-remote-connect-failed/</guid><category domain="https://travisbikkle.github.io/categories/archived/">Archived</category><description>&lt;p>某业务通过Hibernate访问mysql，后台报错 Access denied for user
&lt;em>matexxx&lt;/em>@&lt;em>xxxx&lt;/em> (using password: YES);
一般搞过开发的人都知道，这种问题不是密码错了，就是远程连接未打开，这两者其实都属于一个问题，就是用户的grant权限问题，但是此业务情况稍特殊。定位过程如下。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>使用 Systemd 托管的 Mysql 最大连接数问题</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2019/01/systemd-mysql-maxconnections/</link><pubDate>Sun, 20 Jan 2019 11:24:15 +0800</pubDate><author>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</author><guid>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2019/01/systemd-mysql-maxconnections/</guid><category domain="https://travisbikkle.github.io/categories/archived/">Archived</category><description>&lt;p>最大连接数问题&lt;/p>
&lt;p>背景： mysql 最大连接数在设置为2000的情况下，并发始终只能达到480多；
其它遇到过类似情况的项目组更改ulimit -s（stack
size）到1024可以解决问题，但是我们经过测试无效；
据说前期定位人员咨询过mysql原厂的人，没发现有什么配置问题。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Tcpdump 常用命令</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2019/01/tcpdump-common-commands/</link><pubDate>Sat, 12 Jan 2019 11:24:18 +0800</pubDate><author>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</author><guid>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2019/01/tcpdump-common-commands/</guid><category domain="https://travisbikkle.github.io/categories/archived/">Archived</category><description>&lt;ol>
